When you kill that wraith or giant and are already satiated, you need
to:

- Put on a couple of rings.  Regeneration if you have it.  I guess
hunger too, although I've never seen any estimate of how fast it drained
your food.

- Teleport using ^T until satiation goes away.  If you have teleport
control, just go back to the same spot.

- If teleporting isn't an option, "40." before eating.  This is always
enough for me to get a prompt if I overeat.  (Beware if a monster
strolls by and interrupts your waiting.)  "45." is also usually OK, but
occasionally the corpse will disappear.

- If you get the continue prompt, answer no but "40." again and try
again.  Do this enough times, and you will finish the corpse -- even a
dragon or giant corpse.

